OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance service predicts mental
OL,4,Ahealth spike
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ambulance service has claimed
OL,7,Fresponding to mental health crises will
OL,8,Fbe its fastest growing challenge over
OL,9,Fthe next decade.
OL,11,FNorth East Ambulance Service (NEAS) has
OL,12,Fproduced a series of documents
OL,13,Fpredicting health needs over the next
OL,14,F10 years, along with general principles
OL,15,Fon how it will respond to such "major
OL,16,Fchanges".
OL,18,FThese include dealing with an ageing
OL,19,Fpopulation, rising numbers of people
OL,20,Fwith long-term conditions, growing
OL,21,Fdemand for mental health support and
OL,22,Fpersistent health inequalities.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
